# The package allowlist of the authority host, read by ah-noaicheck (see
# ../README.md). One package name per line, as pacman names it; blank lines
# and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# Empty on purpose: the lead fills it from the host's baseline at deploy
# time. While it is empty, packages are not enforced and the check prints
# "NOTE packages not enforced"; forbidden-packages.list still applies.
